  "permissionRules": [
    "Remove inaccessible destinations from navigation, or explain access. Never tease unusable actions (13.1).",
    "Field roles must not see owner financial data without explicit permission (16.1).",
    "Owners are scoped to their own properties by owner_id on every query.",
    "Read-without-edit shows the value plus the permission microcopy pattern (18.1)."
